for example,

6
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,730
every account is linked

7
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,850
to a human or an

8
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,490
institution, as opposed

9
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:14,518
